            "value": "~%lld perc"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS blocks NUT Client from reaching the UPS server %@. Switch on NUTClient in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Local Network; the connection then starts by itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A macOS nem engedi, hogy a NUT Client el\u00e9rje a(z) %@ UPS szervert. Kapcsold be a NUTClient-et itt: Rendszerbe\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok > Adatv\u00e9delem \u00e9s biztons\u00e1g > Helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zat; a kapcsolat ezut\u00e1n mag\u00e1t\u00f3l l\u00e9trej\u00f6n."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS blocks the connection: switch on NUTClient in System Settings > Privacy & Security > Local Network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hu": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A macOS blokkolja a kapcsolatot: kapcsold be a NUTClient-et itt: Rendszerbe\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00e1sok > Adatv\u00e9delem \u00e9s biztons\u00e1g > Helyi h\u00e1l\u00f3zat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
